    "While platform ad revenue covers your operating overhead and affiliate commissions provide compounding monthly software income, Monetization Tier Three represents the ultimate inflection point of exponential profitability: creating and selling your own Proprietary Digital Products and Info-Arbitrage Assets. When you promote affiliate offers, you capture twenty to forty percent of the transaction value; when you sell your own digital products, you capture one hundred percent of the customer payment at ninety-five percent net profit margins, while building an owned customer database that permanently elevates your media enterprise valuation.",
