    "Promote your most reliable, technically gifted editor into a Lead Operations Manager as your portfolio scales past five channels. The operations manager assumes responsibility for daily quality assurance reviews, assigning script topics to editors, managing cloud asset uploads, and monitoring delivery deadlines. Compensate them with a base management salary plus an equity-like profit share on total portfolio net revenue. Elevating an operations manager completely removes you from daily production firefighting.",
    "Practice Generous Stewardship and Professional Human Dignity with your international team. Pay your contractors immediately upon invoice submission, send holiday bonuses, celebrate personal life milestones, and provide them with constructive, encouraging mentorship. While exploitative agencies treat overseas talent like disposable cogs, the commanding media architect builds a loyal, long-term corporate family that will move mountains to ensure your media empire dominates its categories.",
